+From 1d2bbcb9df6f42f1e286ff43b132c387674091c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Kirn Gill II <segin2005@gmail.com>
+Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 21:52:27 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH 23/83] cde: build dtappbuilder + ttsnoop via a host-native
+ dtcodegen (openmotif)
+MIME-Version: 1.0
+Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
+Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
+
+dtappbuilder's src/ab and ttsnoop generate their *_ui.c/_ui.h sources at
+build time by RUNNING dtcodegen — which links Motif, so the cross-built
+one can't execute on the build host.  Both programs were deferred on
+"needs a host Motif".  The build host has one (Arch ships openmotif in
+extra), so:
+
+- hosttools/build.sh: new dtcodegen-host section.  Copies the fetched
+  CDE tree into hosttools/cde-host, configures it natively (gcc, host
+  tirpc/Xinerama/Motif), builds util (in-tree tradcpp is DtWidget's
+  GENCPP), the libraries dtcodegen links (make -C lib -k: the
+  DtMmdb/dtinfo pieces fail natively and aren't needed), and the
+  AppBuilder libs + dtcodegen with LDFLAGS=-static-libtool-libs so the
+  in-tree Dt/tt libs are linked statically — the staged binary is
+  relocatable (only system Xm/Xt/X11/tirpc are dynamic).  Skipped with
+  a warning when /usr/include/Xm/Xm.h is absent.
+
+- build.sh: when hosttools provides dtcodegen-host, a phase after the
+  main make cross-builds the AppBuilder libs + the (unrunnable) cross
+  dtcodegen, overwrites the libtool wrapper with the host binary, and
+  builds programs/dtappbuilder + programs/ttsnoop; both then install
+  into dist-cde.  dtappbuilder/ttsnoop stay out of programs/Makefile
+  SUBDIRS either way.
+
+  Static-archive fixups (upstream links these shared, where the exe's
+  copy interposes silently; substrate links them static):
+  * MRESOURCELIB=-lMrm on the make line — dtbuilder_LDADD references
+    it for the Mrm Urm* symbols libUil.a needs, but it's an Imake-era
+    variable nothing in configure ever sets.
+  * libABil's yacc globals (yyparse/yylex/yyerror/yylval/...) renamed
+    via DEFS — they collide with the same set exported by Motif's
+    libUil.a.
+  * ttsnoop.C's portable _tt_sigset renamed via DEFS — also defined
+    in libtt.
+
+Produces /usr/dt/bin/dtbuilder (16.5M), ttsnoop (10.6M) and the
+on-target dtcodegen (5.0M), staged into dist-cde for the next image.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
